WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.949
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.219 --> 00:28.973
Can this day be any hotter?

3
00:31.768 --> 00:33.895
We still have to water the crops.

4
00:34.604 --> 00:36.230
What's that?

5
00:36.981 --> 00:40.485
I think I hear a water buffalo talking.

6
00:41.027 --> 00:42.277
So strange.

7
00:42.278 --> 00:43.654
Why...

8
00:44.655 --> 00:46.824
Do I sound like a water buffalo?

9
00:48.659 --> 00:50.953
You look like one.

10
00:52.497 --> 00:54.874
Stop it. Hey!

11
01:00.546 --> 01:01.713
So that's what you like?

12
01:01.714 --> 01:05.051
I'll ride you then.

13
01:15.279 --> 01:16.487
Water buffalo!

14
01:16.511 --> 01:18.180
I'll ride you!

15
01:32.286 --> 01:35.914
- All you think about is your money. - Can we please lower our voices?

16
01:35.915 --> 01:39.501
We're in the hospital now. Your money can wait!

17
01:39.502 --> 01:40.669
You never pitch in!

18
01:40.670 --> 01:41.773
Stop it...

19
01:41.797 --> 01:45.132
Think of the money for the hospital bills first.

20
01:45.133 --> 01:46.008
All of you get out!

21
01:46.009 --> 01:49.136
Lilia, all you do is talk. What do you even contribute?

22
01:49.137 --> 01:51.054
You shut up, Camilia.

23
01:51.055 --> 01:55.475
- I said get out! - You're too selfish, Lilia.

24
01:55.476 --> 01:56.811
Stop it.

25
01:57.061 --> 01:57.854
Lilia...

26
01:57.855 --> 02:00.439
- Why would I stop? - Auntie...

27
02:01.524 --> 02:02.942
Please, Lilia.

28
02:03.484 --> 02:04.735
Jorge...

29
02:06.487 --> 02:10.365
Get my card.

30
02:10.366 --> 02:12.159
Withdraw 50,000 pesos.

31
02:12.160 --> 02:12.910
Okay, Grandpa.

32
02:12.911 --> 02:15.871
What do you think we should do?

33
02:15.872 --> 02:18.875
You think of something.

34
02:19.876 --> 02:22.170
ATM? Okay.

35
02:23.921 --> 02:28.550
Go ahead, solve our problem.

36
02:28.551 --> 02:30.802
You're all talk, Lilia.

37
02:30.803 --> 02:33.431
Think of how you can help out!

38
02:46.903 --> 02:47.903
Hey.

39
02:48.154 --> 02:50.489
Why are you still here?

40
02:50.823 --> 02:54.034
Your parents might be looking for you.

41
02:54.035 --> 02:55.994
My parents are not here.

42
02:55.995 --> 02:57.163
And...

43
02:59.832 --> 03:03.711
- You took my helmet. - Oh, yeah.

44
03:05.421 --> 03:06.923
It's okay.

45
03:08.549 --> 03:11.886
Wanna grab something to eat?

46
03:16.390 --> 03:18.100
Let's make it quick, okay?

47
03:19.018 --> 03:23.147
And can we find an ATM nearby?

48
03:27.401 --> 03:29.111
Hold tight.

49
03:34.500 --> 03:39.500
"All the Things I Leave You" (Episode 2)

50
03:39.956 --> 03:41.999
Wait here.

51
03:53.636 --> 03:56.555
Please sir, don't steal from me.

52
04:00.518 --> 04:02.644
What do you think of me?

53
04:02.645 --> 04:04.355
A robber?

54
04:04.981 --> 04:08.066
I'm too handsome to be a robber.

55
04:08.067 --> 04:11.653
Do you have to stand so close to me?

56
04:11.654 --> 04:14.906
I know that you'll be withdrawing a lot of money.

57
04:14.907 --> 04:17.617
So I need to stand guard.

58
04:17.618 --> 04:20.121
We don't know what could happen.

59
04:21.372 --> 04:23.707
Your call. Whatever.

60
04:23.708 --> 04:25.960
Continue. I won't look.

61
04:28.462 --> 04:32.258
1-4-3-4-4...

62
04:33.342 --> 04:35.469
I love you very much?

63
04:39.140 --> 04:40.891
What?

64
04:43.394 --> 04:45.228
That's what you said.

65
04:45.229 --> 04:48.065
I love you very much.

66
04:49.400 --> 04:51.901
I thought you said you won't look.

67
04:51.902 --> 04:54.363
Yeah but you talk so loud.

68
04:57.783 --> 05:01.995
1-4-3-4-4.

69
05:01.996 --> 05:04.831
I-Love-You-Very-Much.

70
05:04.832 --> 05:06.625
Okay, fine.

71
05:10.629 --> 05:12.506
You done?

72
05:15.801 --> 05:17.845
Yeah. Let's go.

73
05:58.719 --> 06:01.304
Choo-choo...

74
06:01.305 --> 06:03.724
Open wide.

75
06:04.517 --> 06:06.351
Can you stop?

76
06:06.352 --> 06:08.269
I'm not a baby.

77
06:08.270 --> 06:13.317
I'll treat you like one if you don't eat your miki.

78
06:14.151 --> 06:15.736
You're wasting money.

79
06:16.237 --> 06:18.363
Your choice.

80
06:18.364 --> 06:22.118
Eat up or I treat you like a baby.

81
06:25.454 --> 06:27.998
You realize it's hot, right?

82
06:29.166 --> 06:30.458
Then blow on it.

83
06:30.459 --> 06:33.712
Do you want me to blow on it?

84
06:43.556 --> 06:44.932
Jorge.

85
06:45.724 --> 06:48.351
You're close with your grandpa, aren't you?

86
06:48.352 --> 06:49.686
Of course.

87
06:49.687 --> 06:53.983
I'm closer to my grandpa than to my dad.

88
06:56.610 --> 06:57.695
Why?

89
06:58.863 --> 06:59.947
No reason.

90
07:00.865 --> 07:03.242
I just noticed.

91
07:06.078 --> 07:07.705
What about you?

92
07:08.205 --> 07:12.959
You said your parents aren't here.

93
07:12.960 --> 07:14.545
Where are they?

94
07:16.005 --> 07:17.756
They're in Cagayan.

95
07:19.758 --> 07:20.758
Cagayan?

96
07:20.759 --> 07:22.470
Yes. Why?

97
07:24.763 --> 07:27.475
What are you doing here then?

98
07:28.350 --> 07:30.144
I'm with you.

99
07:31.979 --> 07:33.397
Kidding.

100
07:35.232 --> 07:36.816
I'm here to work.

101
07:36.817 --> 07:38.736
You don't study anymore?

102
07:39.904 --> 07:41.530
I stopped.

103
07:43.324 --> 07:48.161
I finished high school, then I needed to work.

104
07:48.162 --> 07:51.540
How about you? Where do you study?

105
07:55.503 --> 07:57.546
I stopped too.

106
07:57.922 --> 08:01.509
I'm training to manage the restaurant.

107
08:03.260 --> 08:07.890
It's better than going to college.

108
08:08.766 --> 08:12.936
But I also graduated high school, okay?

109
08:12.937 --> 08:16.273
So we both stopped studying.

110
08:17.441 --> 08:18.816
What do they call it again?

111
08:18.817 --> 08:19.817
Gap...

112
08:20.194 --> 08:23.280
Gap ban years?

113
08:25.491 --> 08:27.576
Gap boy years.

114
08:28.911 --> 08:30.578
Gap boy years?

115
08:30.579 --> 08:35.292
- Gap year boys. - Oh! Gap years boys.

116
08:38.838 --> 08:41.089
Nah.

117
08:41.090 --> 08:43.007
Mine is a career choice.

118
08:43.008 --> 08:46.261
- A career choice. - Wow.

119
08:46.262 --> 08:48.012
Career choice.

120
08:48.013 --> 08:50.099
Wish I could say that.

121
08:52.142 --> 08:53.977
So, we're not the same.

122
08:53.978 --> 08:55.437
We're different.

123
08:56.897 --> 09:00.484
If you say so.

124
09:04.488 --> 09:05.572
Jorge.

125
09:05.573 --> 09:07.825
I would like to apologize.

126
09:08.576 --> 09:10.911
I was in a rush this morning.

127
09:15.499 --> 09:18.543
I wanted to say sorry too.

128
09:18.544 --> 09:20.588
I was just so angry.

129
09:21.297 --> 09:23.673
We can forget about it now.

130
09:23.674 --> 09:25.801
Let's start over.

131
09:27.928 --> 09:30.096
Okay. Eat more.

132
09:30.097 --> 09:32.641
Talk less.

133
09:53.954 --> 09:56.289
Where's grandpa?

134
09:56.290 --> 09:57.916
What happened to auntie?

135
09:59.043 --> 10:01.253
She fainted, Jorge.

136
10:01.670 --> 10:02.671
Why?

137
10:02.921 --> 10:05.215
Your grandpa's gone.

138
10:05.966 --> 10:08.510
He's gone.

139
10:14.683 --> 10:17.393
Jorge!

140
10:17.394 --> 10:18.394
Nurse!

141
10:19.146 --> 10:20.229
Jorge.

142
10:20.230 --> 10:21.230
Nurse.

143
10:51.804 --> 10:53.846
What happened?

144
10:53.847 --> 10:55.598
Don't worry, Jorge.

145
10:55.599 --> 10:57.559
Nothing happened between us.

146
10:58.394 --> 11:00.561
You fainted last night.

147
11:00.562 --> 11:02.773
Jorge, let me borrow this.

148
11:03.899 --> 11:06.609
Am I having a bad dream?

149
11:06.610 --> 11:08.027
No, Jorge.

150
11:08.028 --> 11:11.364
What you heard last night was true.

151
11:11.365 --> 11:13.283
Your grandpa is gone.

152
11:14.702 --> 11:17.246
My condolences.

153
11:20.040 --> 11:23.585
Sorry, I don't have a shirt for you to wipe your snot on.

154
11:24.336 --> 11:27.548
You can do it on my towel.

155
11:29.591 --> 11:31.343
You're crazy.

156
11:31.719 --> 11:33.512
Why haven't you gone home?

157
11:33.929 --> 11:36.055
You fell last night.

158
11:36.056 --> 11:39.309
You were so heavy that you hit your head on the stairs.

159
11:40.102 --> 11:44.772
Your aunt and dad also went to the funeral parlor.

160
11:44.773 --> 11:48.193
So they asked me if I can stay and watch you.

161
11:49.027 --> 11:52.740
Your aunt and I cleaned earlier too.

162
11:55.784 --> 11:57.869
It's not a big deal.

163
11:57.870 --> 11:59.955
The extra cash was nice.

164
12:02.207 --> 12:05.126
So why are you only wearing a towel?

165
12:05.127 --> 12:07.170
I just took a shower.

166
12:07.171 --> 12:11.591
It skipped my mind that I didn't bring fresh clothes.

167
12:11.592 --> 12:13.510
My shirt...

168
12:13.719 --> 12:16.137
You used it to wipe your snot.

169
12:16.138 --> 12:19.015
So, can I borrow some clothes?

170
12:19.016 --> 12:21.685
No need, you can stay like that.

171
12:23.687 --> 12:25.856
You like that?

172
12:29.234 --> 12:32.570
Wait, let met get a jersey.

173
12:32.571 --> 12:34.865
Jorge.

174
12:36.158 --> 12:38.702
Pick a nice jersey, okay?

175
12:43.040 --> 12:44.166
Jorge.

176
12:45.459 --> 12:47.961
Can't you hand it over nicely, Jorge?

177
12:50.047 --> 12:52.090
Here it is, boss.

178
12:55.093 --> 12:58.138
What are you doing?

179
13:02.893 --> 13:05.312
I already saw it.

180
13:10.859 --> 13:12.444
Hmmm...

181
13:17.991 --> 13:18.991
Hmmm...

182
13:21.286 --> 13:22.286
Hmmm...

183
13:23.163 --> 13:24.163
But...

184
13:24.373 --> 13:26.332
You took a shower together, didn't you?

185
13:26.333 --> 13:28.000
Ruth. Watch your mouth.

186
13:28.001 --> 13:32.256
What? I'm just asking.

187
13:32.589 --> 13:35.758
Clean your mind. It's so dirty.

188
13:35.759 --> 13:36.759
And hey!

189
13:37.386 --> 13:38.678
For your information,

190
13:38.679 --> 13:40.472
we did not shower together.

191
13:42.641 --> 13:44.308
It's good for you to know...

192
13:44.309 --> 13:48.604
It's forbidden to shower once the dead body is in the house.

193
13:48.605 --> 13:52.943
That's what the elders say around here.

194
13:57.489 --> 13:59.282
But...

195
13:59.283 --> 14:02.369
You slept together, didn't you?

196
14:04.705 --> 14:06.247
No!

197
14:06.248 --> 14:08.876
I slept in the living room.

198
14:09.585 --> 14:11.879
Really?

199
14:13.922 --> 14:17.801
Mmm... you two.

200
14:20.304 --> 14:23.222
So, that's why you're wearing his jersey.

201
14:23.223 --> 14:24.308
Fine.

202
14:25.058 --> 14:26.058
Okay.

203
14:26.476 --> 14:27.852
If you say so.

204
14:27.853 --> 14:29.896
Jorge.

205
14:29.897 --> 14:30.897
Kiko.

206
14:31.648 --> 14:35.444
Hail Mary, full of grace...

207
14:41.658 --> 14:46.455
Our Father in heaven...

208
14:46.997 --> 14:51.500
You know, Tino is one of the kindest people in San Nicolas.

209
14:51.501 --> 14:53.044
Yes, I remember.

210
14:53.045 --> 14:54.754
He helped my kid back then.

211
14:54.755 --> 14:57.883
He's really kind.

212
15:18.779 --> 15:20.572
Jorge...

213
15:23.200 --> 15:28.330
Do you hear what people are saying about Grandpa Tino?

214
15:29.623 --> 15:32.834
Some of them. Why?

215
15:33.669 --> 15:34.669
No reason.

216
15:34.670 --> 15:40.550
It seems Boss Tino was a really good man.

217
15:45.931 --> 15:48.225
Why are you wearing a black pin?

218
15:50.560 --> 15:53.188
- Yes, that one. - Why?

219
15:54.564 --> 15:57.109
In our family,

220
15:57.776 --> 16:01.446
we only wear it after the funeral.

221
16:02.531 --> 16:06.243
Different families have different beliefs.

222
16:14.751 --> 16:16.920
Are you going home?

223
16:18.672 --> 16:20.798
They say...

224
16:20.799 --> 16:25.302
You're not allowed to say goodbye at a wake.

225
16:25.303 --> 16:27.723
So, you should stay here.

226
16:29.141 --> 16:31.435
I know that.

227
16:32.728 --> 16:35.438
Do you want me...

228
16:35.439 --> 16:38.358
to leave without warning?

229
16:40.652 --> 16:41.777
Well.

230
16:41.778 --> 16:44.990
You showed up without warning either.

231
16:46.616 --> 16:48.117
You're crazy.

232
16:48.118 --> 16:49.953
You're crazier.

233
16:52.539 --> 16:54.708
Should I go now?

234
16:56.960 --> 16:59.504
Up to you.

235
17:06.720 --> 17:07.888
Lilia.

236
17:08.513 --> 17:10.432
Lilia.

237
17:11.141 --> 17:12.601
Insiong?

238
17:13.852 --> 17:16.562
Can I ask for a favor?

239
17:16.563 --> 17:19.191
What now? You'll borrow money again?

240
17:22.903 --> 17:25.071
It's for...

241
17:25.072 --> 17:28.491
Jorge's college.

242
17:28.492 --> 17:31.202
I want him to finish his studies.

243
17:31.203 --> 17:36.957
Why would I lend you more money when you haven't paid what you owe?

244
17:36.958 --> 17:40.544
You never pay unless I remind you.

245
17:40.545 --> 17:42.714
Think about it, Insiong.

246
17:43.840 --> 17:45.300
Lilia...

247
17:47.386 --> 17:49.637
I have a plan.

248
17:49.638 --> 17:51.890
What is it?

249
17:52.599 --> 17:54.726
Here it goes.

250
17:55.102 --> 18:02.984
You'll manage dad's restaurant for now.

251
18:03.735 --> 18:05.653
I'm the eldest son.

252
18:05.654 --> 18:09.658
I'm certain that I will inherit the restaurant.

253
18:10.408 --> 18:18.408
You can have the restaurant until I can pay for all the money I borrowed.

254
18:19.793 --> 18:22.419
I'll agree if we put it in writing.

255
18:22.420 --> 18:25.340
We need a contract for that.

256
18:26.550 --> 18:28.801
Contract?

257
18:28.802 --> 18:30.594
Okay.

258
18:30.595 --> 18:32.680
Let's make it official.

259
18:32.681 --> 18:36.935
- Until Jorge finishes college. - Okay. For Jorge.

260
18:37.561 --> 18:40.313
Okay, I'm good with that.

261
18:40.939 --> 18:43.150
- Thank you. - Okay.

262
18:49.739 --> 18:51.533
Hey, Jorge.

263
18:51.908 --> 18:53.493
I need to tell you something.

264
18:53.618 --> 18:57.121
All you do is gossip. Why don't you help?

265
18:57.122 --> 18:59.915
I'll help you later. This is important.

266
18:59.916 --> 19:03.210
And hey, this is about you...

267
19:03.211 --> 19:04.754
and the restaurant.

268
19:09.885 --> 19:14.181
Your Dad and Aunt Lilia had an agreement.

269
19:15.140 --> 19:16.683
What?

270
19:17.517 --> 19:22.062
They're planning to sell the restaurant so you can continue studying.

271
19:22.063 --> 19:26.359
They won't give it to you to manage because they'll sell it.

272
19:49.799 --> 19:50.800
Dad...

273
19:51.092 --> 19:52.718
I won't go to college.

274
19:52.719 --> 19:55.347
Take back what you told Auntie.

275
19:58.850 --> 20:00.477
Son...

276
20:01.186 --> 20:03.688
Finish your studies.

277
20:04.439 --> 20:09.736
Dad, you can't give the restaurant to Auntie because it's mine.

278
20:11.196 --> 20:13.280
Yours?

279
20:13.281 --> 20:14.740
Who...

280
20:14.741 --> 20:16.785
Who told you that?

281
20:17.953 --> 20:19.496
Grandpa Tino.

282
20:20.330 --> 20:22.707
Do you have it on paper?

283
20:24.209 --> 20:26.168
Do you have proof?

284
20:26.169 --> 20:29.464
Show it to me.

285
20:33.260 --> 20:34.761
But, Dad...

286
20:36.554 --> 20:39.391
No more questions.

287
20:39.849 --> 20:44.104
You will do whatever I say.

288
20:48.149 --> 20:50.985
You didn't fulfill Grandpa's dream for you.

289
20:50.986 --> 20:52.736
That's why you're like that.

290
20:52.737 --> 20:54.823
What?

291
20:56.783 --> 20:59.911
Insiong, take it easy.

292
21:09.588 --> 21:11.548
Jorge.

293
21:13.800 --> 21:15.802
Jorge!

294
21:40.910 --> 21:42.578
What are you doing?

295
21:42.579 --> 21:44.789
Can I ride with you?

296
21:45.332 --> 21:47.542
But I'm going home.

297
21:48.501 --> 21:50.794
Just be with me.

298
21:50.795 --> 21:52.964
Why? Where are you going?

299
21:53.673 --> 21:55.300
Don't ask.

300
21:55.717 --> 21:57.134
Why?

301
21:57.135 --> 21:59.429
Are you tired of me already?

302
22:24.829 --> 22:29.084
Hold on tight.
